职位描述:
主要岗位职责：
1. Manages and oversees the integration projects with our key global partners;
2. End-to-end capability and vision of bringing competitive hotel product offerings from partners to our end customers;
3. Implements methodologically the systems and processes to support and achieve business objectives, with a bias for action;
4. Provides product management authority in defining direct connectivity product roadmap and feature priorities;
5. Learns quickly and eventually masters the internal system modules, interface contracts and information flow, assures the successful launch of new product features and competitive offers;
6. Balances between exigence from business users / partners and engineering considerations;
7. Leads the technical conversation in a commercial context, presents and sells ideas at ease with a senior leadership audience either internally or externally;
8. Masters OTA industry standards (e.g. OpenTravel, HTNG), authors external interface specifications, integration model structure as well as processing logics, at conceptual and logical layers.
